<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun a land operation against cartels inside Ecuador while President Noboa asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid and met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation. The United States has paused joint military operations, a move the Ecuadorian government denies, and the Trump administration is investigating alleged human-rights abuse in Operation Hegseth. Journalist Omar Toledo was shot by motorcycle gunmen and wounded, and fugitive gang boss William Joffre Alcívar Bautista, alias Willy, was arrested at a hotel in Sitges and deported from Spain. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxObE5nanR6MkRMRlN6cFpLRjNoMnVpblFGc3pRSWh1bFMydF8yOUlqTDA3UmhjSzFIejdjY21ZeC1IWG9EWEx1cUFkc3pyeFBMa0VBMEtLb1Z2TFdudTlqYWJnT3R2c0wyYWZWa3NMM2ZDN1A3ZE1Ea091WjVLUTN3U2RvVGR5Z1RqWVlURl8tUFdFWWpYbkM4YVlmU1JOY3hUaWFaVEVDUWhEN2NKMjltMy04SzRiaXVldFBORGhma3Z1WDhOa0k2bl9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;timesdaily.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOdHJvMDY5cVRtZXIySTAwRzA1eGRHVnVmVWw2aXNId0hQNlF6RWhNdTQ3VXFYOVI0RU9GUnN6bjhDQURBeXZ3WGRsZHVCejdJejBpcVVWenl6bkgzcnlGckQyLTJpdTJxdEhBTEFpNXRpY1dqYXNhQTZRc3pEb1pUcVh6TnYtZ3JBeDNpZFFVeE1RVHFzZFJjTmI4aDlFYktxWW04dDZJTFBxWXJTTUEyU05rajRoMzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;WV News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQRm1HTndRU0h4UWEwVG9RVlRndnBrRTh3X2RzbTZ4THZ1UEI0aS1vMExXR2IxRG41RlczbmpwRzlUaUpjRUpVa3pSR2JaZldXMTVXUldwbmxFa1RkQmF5SVlZcmhycGZqRU0xakpFR1FfWWR1aFBaYVZGNUlLNW1UcnBucEFPa1E0YUdscjVKUFM5ZkJSRXdNUnFzU2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quo